{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 49, :comments ["<b>Or his uncle.</b> This is the Holy One, blessed be He, as it is said: ״זה דודי וזה רעי״." "<b>Or the son of his uncle.</b> This is King Mashiach, for concerning him it is said: ״אמר אלי בני אתה״, as the Sages, of blessed memory, expounded it in tractate Sukkah." "<b>Or his hand has attained.</b> By means of mitzvot and merits that are in his hand, and he will be redeemed."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:08:37.969711096Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}